ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,
ItemName,tidal orb,
PropertyDescription,Innate (Bladeform): Gain 1 stack every 4 turns without taking damage (up to 10 stacks). Each stack grants +1% movement speed and +2.5% agility strike power and attack speed; lingers 4 turns after taking damage.,
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,
PropertyDescription,"Innate (One Man Army): While no living allies are within 4 tiles (lingers 6 turns when an ally approaches), Axe gains bonus Strength equal to 50% of his excess Defence (Defence - 10), increasing melee attack damage.","Innate (One Man Army): While no living allies are within 4 tiles (lingers 6 turns when an ally approaches), Axe gains bonus Strength equal to 50% of his excess Defense (Defense - 10), increasing melee attack damage."
PropertyDescription,Leaping between nearby enemies in a blur of invulnerable strikes: immune to all damage and debuffs while slashing a nearby foe each turn.,
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Blade Dance): Melee attacks, Omnislash strikes, and Blade Fury spins have a 20% / 25% / 30% / 35% chance (by Blade Dance skill level 1-4) to critically strike for 1.8x damage.",
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Counter Helix): Every 7 / 6 / 5 / 4 incoming attacks (by Counter Helix skill level 1-4, including missed attacks) triggers a 3x3 crimson axe spin dealing 100 / 120 / 140 / 160 Pure damage (1d6+3 to 3d6).","Passive (Counter Helix): Every 7 / 6 / 5 / 4 incoming attacks (by Counter Helix skill level 1-4, including missed attacks) triggers a 3x3 crimson ax spin dealing 100 / 120 / 140 / 160 Pure damage (1d6+3 to 3d6)."
PropertyDescription,"Spinning in a destructive storm of blades: immune to debuffs, 80% magical damage reduction, and dealing magical damage around you each turn.",
